*      FAP                                                              SERI0001
*CALLING PROGRAM FOR WD SERI                                            SERI0002
       COUNT   2                                                        SERI0003
       CALL    SERIAL                                                   SERI0004
       END                                                              SERI0005
*      FAP                                                              SERI0006
*      PAUSE, THEN CALL SERIAL                                          SERI0007
       COUNT   5                                                        SERI0008
       ENTRY   SERIPS                                                   SERI0009
A      BOOL    52525                                                    SERI0010
SERIPS HPR     A,2                                                      SERI0011
       CALL    SERIAL                                                   SERI0012
       END                                                              SERI0013
*      FAP                                                              SERI0014
       COUNT   65                                                       SERI0015
*      PACK SUBROUTINE     SQUEEZES OUT BLANKS                          SERI0016
       ENTRY   (PACK)                                                   SERI0017
*                                                                       SERI0018
*CALLING SEQUENCE                                                       SERI0019
*      CALL    (PACK),UNPACKED,PACKED,COUNT                             SERI0020
*                                                                       SERI0021
*SUBROUTINE TAKES DATA FROM UNPACKED,STORES PACKED DATA IN              SERI0022
*PACKED. RETURNS WHEN COUNT WORDS HAVE BEEN TREATED.                    SERI0023
*PACKED AND UNPACKED MUST BOTH BE OF LENGTH AT LEAST EQUAL TO COUNT     SERI0024
*                                                                       SERI0025
(PACK) SXA     XA,1                                                     SERI0026
       SXA     XB,2                                                     SERI0027
       SXA     XC,4                                                     SERI0028
       STI     SI                                                       SERI0029
       CLA     3,4           INITIALIZE                                 SERI0030
       STA     COUNT                                                    SERI0031
       CLA     1,4                                                      SERI0032
       ADM     COUNT                                                    SERI0033
       STA     UNPKD                                                    SERI0034
       CLA     2,4                                                      SERI0035
       ADM     COUNT                                                    SERI0036
       STA     PACKED                                                   SERI0037
COUNT  AXT     *-*,6                                                    SERI0038
       CLA     =1                                                       SERI0039
       TOV     *+1                                                      SERI0040
       TRA     UNPKD         JUMP INTO SCAN                             SERI0041
NEXTCH TIX     CHA,1,1       PICK UP NEXT CHARACTER                     SERI0042
       TNX     DONE,2,1      IS THERE ANOTHER WORD                      SERI0043
UNPKD  LDI     *-*,2         YES, CHECK IT FOR ALL BLANKS               SERI0044
       IIS     =H                                                       SERI0045
       OFT     INFTY                                                    SERI0046
       TRA     *+2                                                      SERI0047
       TRA     NEXTCH+1                                                 SERI0048
       LDQ*    UNPKD                                                    SERI0049
       AXT     6,1                                                      SERI0050
CHA    LGL     6             SHIFT IN ONE CHARACTER                     SERI0051
       PAI                                                              SERI0052
       IIR     60                                                       SERI0053
       RFT     77            IS IT A BLANK                              SERI0054
       TRA     NOTBL         NO                                         SERI0055
       ARS     6             YES, IGNORE IT                             SERI0056
       TRA     NEXTCH                                                   SERI0057
NOTBL  TNO     NEXTCH        NOT A BLANK, ARE THERE SIX                 SERI0058
PACKED SLW     *-*,4         YES, STORE PACKED WORD                     SERI0059
       CLA     =1            CLEAR AC EXCEPT FOR OVERFLOWER,            SERI0060
       TIX     NEXTCH,4,1    HIT XR4, AND RETURN TO THE FRAY            SERI0061
       TRA     LV            THERE WERE NO BLANKS, QUIT                 SERI0062
*                                                                       SERI0063
DONE   LDQ     =H            FILL OUT LAST WORD                         SERI0064
       LGL     6                                                        SERI0065
       TNO     *-1                                                      SERI0066
       SLW*    PACKED                                                   SERI0067
       TNX     LV,4,1                                                   SERI0068
       LDQ     =H                                                       SERI0069
       STQ*    PACKED        CLEAR REMAINING PACKED, IF ANY             SERI0070
       TIX     *-1,4,1                                                  SERI0071
LV     LDI     SI                                                       SERI0072
XA     AXT     *-*,1                                                    SERI0073
XB     AXT     *-*,2                                                    SERI0074
XC     AXT     *-*,4                                                    SERI0075
       TRA     4,4                                                      SERI0076
SI                                                                      SERI0077
INFTY  VFD     36/-1                                                    SERI0078
       END                                                              SERI0079
*      FAP                                                              SERI0080
*      RD AND WR SUBROUTINES FOR SERIAL ROUTINE                         SERI0081
       COUNT   90                                                       SERI0082
       ENTRY   (RD)                                                     SERI0083
       ENTRY   (WR)                                                     SERI0084
*                                                                       SERI0085
*SUBROUTINE TO READ ONE RECORD FROM SPECIFIED TAPE                      SERI0086
*AND CONVERT 73-80 TO PROVIDE BETTER COLLATING SEQUENCE                 SERI0087
*                                                                       SERI0088
*CALLING SEQUENCE                                                       SERI0089
*      IFEOF   END-OF-FILE ROUTINE                                      SERI0090
*      CLA     LOGICAL TAPE NUMBER                                      SERI0091
*      CALL    (RD),BUFFER ADDRESS,STORAGE FOR CONVERTED SERIAL         SERI0092
*                                                                       SERI0093
(RD)   SXA     RDXC,4                                                   SERI0094
       STA     RDCALL+1      SET UP CALL                                SERI0095
       CLA     1,4                                                      SERI0096
       STA     RDCALL+2                                                 SERI0097
       ADD     =14                                                      SERI0098
       STA     RDDATA                                                   SERI0099
       CLA     2,4                                                      SERI0100
       ADD     =2                                                       SERI0101
       STA     SERL                                                     SERI0102
RDCALL CALL    READ,*-*,*-*,14                                          SERI0103
       AXT     2,4                                                      SERI0104
RDDATA CAL     *-*,4         CONVERT 73-80 FROM BCD                     SERI0105
       XEC*    $RDTBL)                                                  SERI0106
SERL   SLW     *-*,4                                                    SERI0107
       TIX     *+1,4,1                                                  SERI0108
       CAL*    RDDATA                                                   SERI0109
       ANA     =O777700000000                                           SERI0110
       ORA     =H00          BLANK OUT 80-84                            SERI0111
       SLW*    RDDATA                                                   SERI0112
       XEC*    $RDTBL)                                                  SERI0113
       SLW*    SERL                                                     SERI0114
RDXC   AXT     *-*,4                                                    SERI0115
       TRA     3,4                                                      SERI0116
*                                                                       SERI0117
*SUBROUTINE TO REPLACE 73-80 WITH NEW SERIAL NUMBER IF                  SERI0118
*SO SPECIFIED, TO WRITE THE RECORD ON THE SPECIFIED TAPE                SERI0119
*(BUT IF 73-78 OF THE REOCRD CONTAIN ALL ONES, TO                       SERI0120
*WRITE AN END-OF-FILE MARK ON THE SPECIFIED TAPE), AND                  SERI0121
*TO BUMP THE NEW SERIAL NUMBER (IF ANY).                                SERI0122
*IF THE SPECIFIED TAPE IS LOGICAL ZERO, NOTHING WILL BE WRITTEN.        SERI0123
*                                                                       SERI0124
*CALLING SEQUENCE                                                       SERI0125
*      CLA     LOGICAL TAPE NUMBER                                      SERI0126
*      CALL    (WR),BUFFER ADDRESS                                      SERI0127
*                                                                       SERI0128
(WR)   SXA     WRXA,1                                                   SERI0129
       SXA     WRXC,4                                                   SERI0130
       TZE     WRXA          IF LOGICAL TAPE ZERO, RETURN               SERI0131
       STA     WRCALL+1      OTHERWISE SET UP WRITE AND ENDFIL          SERI0132
       STA     WRWEF+1                                                  SERI0133
       CLA     1,4           SET UP WRITE AND PICKUP                    SERI0134
       STA     WRCALL+2                                                 SERI0135
       ADD     =14                                                      SERI0136
       STA     WRDATA                                                   SERI0137
       AXT     2,4           PICK UP 73-78                              SERI0138
WRDATA CAL     *-*,4                                                    SERI0139
       ERA     INFTY         IF ALL ONES, WRITE END OF FILE             SERI0140
       TZE     WRWEF                                                    SERI0141
       NZT     SERSW         IS SERIAL SWITCH ON                        SERI0142
       TRA     WRCALL        NO                                         SERI0143
WRREP  CAL     NEWSER+2,4    YES, REPLACE SERIAL IN 73-80               SERI0144
       XEC*    $WRTBL)                                                  SERI0145
       SLW*    WRDATA                                                   SERI0146
       TIX     WRREP,4,1                                                SERI0147
       CAL     NEWSER+2,4                                               SERI0148
       ADD     BMPCLM        BUMP SERIAL                                SERI0149
       XEC*    $WRTBL)       CONVERT TO BCD AND BACK                    SERI0150
       XEC*    $RDTBL)       (THIS PROPAGATES CARRY)                    SERI0151
       SLW     NEWSER+1                                                 SERI0152
       CAL     NEWSER        PROPAGATE CARRY THROUGH 73-78              SERI0153
       SXA     *+1,1         (WRTBL LEAVES ADDRESS IN XR1)              SERI0154
       CVR     *-*,,6                                                   SERI0155
       XEC*    $RDTBL)                                                  SERI0156
       SLW     NEWSER                                                   SERI0157
WRCALL CALL    WRITE,*-*,*-*,14 WRITE THE RECORD                        SERI0158
WRXA   AXT     *-*,1                                                    SERI0159
WRXC   AXT     *-*,4                                                    SERI0160
       TRA     2,4           RETURN                                     SERI0161
*                                                                       SERI0162
WRWEF  CALL    ENDFIL,*-*    WRITE END OF FILE                          SERI0163
       TRA     WRXA          RETURN                                     SERI0164
*                                                                       SERI0165
INFTY  VFD     36/-1                                                    SERI0166
BMPCLM BCI     1,100000      BUMP SERIAL IN COLUMN 79                   SERI0167
SERSW  COMMON  1             SERIALIZATION SWITCH                       SERI0168
       COMMON  1             NEW SERIAL NUMBER                          SERI0169
NEWSER COMMON  1             ...(TWO WORDS)                             SERI0170
       END                                                              SERI0171
*      FAP                                                              SERI0172
*RDTBL AND WRTBL     CONVERSION TABLES TO GIVE BETTER COLLATING SEQUENCESERI0173
       COUNT   50                                                       SERI0174
       ENTRY   RDTBL)                                                   SERI0175
       ENTRY   WRTBL)                                                   SERI0176
*                                                                       SERI0177
*RDTBL CONVERTS FROM BCD TO MODIFIED SEQUENCE                           SERI0178
*BLANK 0-9 A-Z +-='.)$*/,(                                              SERI0179
*                                                                       SERI0180
RDTBL) CVR     X,,6                                                     SERI0181
X      DUP     1,10                                                     SERI0182
       VFD     6/*-X+2,30/X                                             SERI0183
       VFD     36/X,6/44,30/X,6/46,30/X,36/X,36/X,36/X,6/40,30/X        SERI0184
       DUP     1,9                                                      SERI0185
       VFD     6/*-X-4,30/X                                             SERI0186
       VFD     36/X,6/48,30/X,6/50,30/X,36/X,36/X,36/X,6/42,30/X        SERI0187
       DUP     1,9                                                      SERI0188
       VFD     6/*-X-11,30/X                                            SERI0189
       VFD     36/X,6/52,30/X,6/54,30/X,36/X,36/X,36/X,36/X,6/56,30/X   SERI0190
       DUP     1,8                                                      SERI0191
       VFD     6/*-X-19,30/X                                            SERI0192
       VFD     36/X,6/58,30/X,6/60,30/X,36/X,6/62,30/X,6/63,30/X        SERI0193
*                                                                       SERI0194
*WRTBL RECONVERTS FROM RDTBL SEQUENCE TO BCD, AND ALSO                  SERI0195
*PROPAGATES CARRIES FROM ADDITION OF ONE                                SERI0196
*LETTERS CYCLE--Z GOES TO A WITH CARRY                                  SERI0197
*DIGITS CYCLE--9 GOES TO ZERO WITH CARRY                                SERI0198
*BLANK GOES TO ONE, AND EVERY SPECIAL CHARACTER GOES TO BLANK           SERI0199
*WITH CARRY                                                             SERI0200
*                                                                       SERI0201
WRTBL) CVR     Y,1,6         LEAVE ADDRESS IN XR1                       SERI0202
Y      VFD     6/48,30/Y                                                SERI0203
Z      VFD     6/1,30/Y                                                 SERI0204
       DUP     1,10                                                     SERI0205
       VFD     6/*-Y-2,30/Y                                             SERI0206
       VFD     36/Z                                                     SERI0207
       DUP     1,9                                                      SERI0208
       VFD     6/*-Y+4,30/Y                                             SERI0209
       DUP     1,9                                                      SERI0210
       VFD     6/*-Y+11,30/Y                                            SERI0211
       DUP     1,8                                                      SERI0212
       VFD     6/*-Y+19,30/Y                                            SERI0213
       VFD     6/17,30/Z,6/16,30/Y,6/48,30/Z,6/32,30/Y                  SERI0214
       VFD     6/48,30/Z,6/11,30/Y,6/48,30/Z,6/12,30/Y                  SERI0215
       VFD     6/48,30/Z,6/27,30/Y,6/48,30/Z,6/28,30/Y                  SERI0216
       VFD     6/48,30/Z,6/43,30/Y,6/48,30/Z,6/44,30/Y                  SERI0217
       VFD     6/48,30/Z,6/49,30/Y,6/48,30/Z,6/59,30/Y                  SERI0218
       VFD     6/48,30/Z,6/60,30/Y,6/48,30/Z,6/62,30/Y                  SERI0219
       VFD     6/63,30/Y,36/Y                                           SERI0220
       END                                                              SERI0221
*      FAP                                                              SERI0222
*      SERIAL PROGRAM     WRITES NEW INPUT TAPE                         SERI0223
       COUNT   340                                                      SERI0224
       ENTRY   SERIAL                                                   SERI0225
       SPACE   1                                                        SERI0226
************************************************************************SERI0227
*                                                                       SERI0228
*INSTALLATION-SPECIFIC PARAMETERS                                       SERI0229
*                                                                       SERI0230
STMINP         5             LOGICAL NUMBER OF SYSTEM INPUT TAPE        SERI0231
STMOUT         6             LOGICAL NUMBER OF SYSTEM OUTPUT TAPE       SERI0232
OLDTAP         10            LOGICAL NUMBER OF NORMAL OLD TAPE          SERI0233
NEWTAP         9             LOGICAL NUMBER OF NORMAL NEW TAPE          SERI0234
FLAG   BCI     1,00000-      COLUMN 1 CHARACTER IDENTIFIES CONTROL CARD SERI0235
*                                                                       SERI0236
*                                                                       SERI0237
*                                                                       SERI0238
************************************************************************SERI0239
       SPACE                                                            SERI0240
SERIAL STL     OLDMT         SET OLD-BUFFER-EMPTY FLAG                  SERI0241
       STZ     DELESW        DELETE SWITCH OFF                          SERI0242
       STZ     SERSW         SERIAL SWITCH OFF                          SERI0243
       STL     FCDSW         FIRST-CARD-OF-FILE SWITCH ON               SERI0244
       STZ     DELTHS        DELETE-THRU SWITCH OFF                     SERI0245
*                                                                       SERI0246
*      READ CONTROL CARD FROM SYSTEM INPUT TAPE INTO 'NEW' BUFFER       SERI0247
*                                                                       SERI0248
A      IFEOF   EOFA          SET END-OF-FILE EXIT                       SERI0249
       CLA     STMINP        PICK UP SYSTEM INPUT TAPE NUMBER           SERI0250
       CALL    (RD),NEW,SERNEW                                          SERI0251
       LDQ     NEW           TEST FOR FLAG IN COLUMN 1                  SERI0252
       CLM                                                              SERI0253
       LGL     6                                                        SERI0254
       ERA     FLAG                                                     SERI0255
       TNZ     ORDNRY        NO                                         SERI0256
       CALL    (PACK),NEW,PACKED,12    YES, PACK UP THE CONTROL CARD    SERI0257
       CAL     PACKED                                                   SERI0258
       ANA     =O7777777777  REMOVE FLAG FROM COLUMN 1                  SERI0259
       AXT     LDICT,4       LOOK UP FIRST SIX CHARACTERS               SERI0260
CCLOOK LAS*    DICT+LDICT,4                                             SERI0261
       TRA     *+2                                                      SERI0262
       TRA*    TDICT+LDICT,4 OFF TO APPROPRIATE ROUTINE                 SERI0263
       TIX     CCLOOK,4,2                                               SERI0264
       PAI                   MAKE SPECIAL TEST FOR 'READ' CONTROL CARD  SERI0265
       IIS     =H0READ0                                                 SERI0266
       OFT     =O7777777760                                             SERI0267
       TRA     *+2                                                      SERI0268
       TRA     READA                                                    SERI0269
*                                                                       SERI0270
BADCC  AXT     5,4           UNRECOGNIZED CONTROL CARD                  SERI0271
       LDQ     BADCCM+5,4                                               SERI0272
       STQ     POSTNW+5,4                                               SERI0273
       TIX     *-2,4,1                                                  SERI0274
       CLA     STMOUT                                                   SERI0275
       STA     *+2                                                      SERI0276
       CALL    WRITE,*-*,PRENEW,20                                      SERI0277
       TRA     A                                                        SERI0278
BADCCM BCI     5,BAD CONTROL CARD -- IGNORED                            SERI0279
DICT           DELETX        DICTIONARY OF CONTROL NAMES                SERI0280
TDICT          DELETE        DICTIONARY OF CONTROL ADDRESSES            SERI0281
               RUNTOX                                                   SERI0282
               RUNTO                                                    SERI0283
               NEWSRX                                                   SERI0284
               NEWSR                                                    SERI0285
               OLDSRX                                                   SERI0286
               OLDSR                                                    SERI0287
               WRITEX                                                   SERI0288
               WRITEA                                                   SERI0289
               ENDFLX                                                   SERI0290
               ENDFL                                                    SERI0291
               REWDX                                                    SERI0292
               REWD                                                     SERI0293
               CLOSEX                                                   SERI0294
               CLOSE                                                    SERI0295
               EXITX                                                    SERI0296
               EXITY                                                    SERI0297
LDICT  EQU     *-DICT                                                   SERI0298
DELETX BCI     2,0DELETE                                                SERI0299
RUNTOX BCI     2,0RUNTHRUEOF                                            SERI0300
NEWSRX BCI     2,0NEWSERIALS                                            SERI0301
OLDSRX BCI     2,0OLDSERIALS                                            SERI0302
WRITEX BCI     1,0WRITE                                                 SERI0303
ENDFLX BCI     2,0ENDFILE00                                             SERI0304
REWDX  BCI     2,0REWIND00                                              SERI0305
CLOSEX BCI     1,0CLOSE                                                 SERI0306
EXITX  BCI     1,0EXIT                                                  SERI0307
*                                                                       SERI0308
EOFA   LDQ     INFTY         END OF FILE ON SYSTEM INPUT TAPE           SERI0309
       STQ     SERNEW        PUT INFINITY IN BOTH HIGH- AND LOW-        SERI0310
       STQ     SERNEW+1      ...ORDER WORDS OF CONVERTED 'NEW' SERIAL   SERI0311
       TRA     B                                                        SERI0312
*                                                                       SERI0313
DELETE LDI     DELETX+1      IS IT REALLY A DELETE CARD                 SERI0314
       IIS     PACKED+1                                                 SERI0315
       LFT     770000                                                   SERI0316
       TRA     CCLOOK        NO                                         SERI0317
       LFT     7700          IS NEXT CHARACTER BLANK                    SERI0318
       TRA     *+2                                                      SERI0319
       TRA     DELB          YES, SET SWITCH AND GO TO B                SERI0320
       IIS     DELEOF        NO, IS EOF NEXT                            SERI0321
       OFT     INFTY                                                    SERI0322
       TRA     DELC          NO, GO CHECK FOR 'DELETE THRU'             SERI0323
DELA   LDQ     INFTY         YES, SET INFINITY IN HIGH ORDER WORD       SERI0324
*                            ...OF CONVERTED SERIAL OF 'NEW' BUFFER,    SERI0325
       STQ     SERNEW                                                   SERI0326
       STZ     SERNEW+1      ...AND ZERO IN LOW-ORDER WORD              SERI0327
DELB   STL     DELESW        SET DELETE SWITCH                          SERI0328
       TRA     B                                                        SERI0329
DELC   IIS     DELTHR        TEST FOR WORD 'THRU'                       SERI0330
       OFT     =O7777777700                                             SERI0331
       TRA     BADCC         NO, BAD CONTROL CARD                       SERI0332
       RFT     77            IS NEXT CHARACTER BLANK                    SERI0333
       TRA     DELD          NO GO CHECK FOR 'THRU EOF'                 SERI0334
       STL     DELTHS        YES, SET DELETE-THRU SWITCH                SERI0335
       TRA     DELB          GO SET DELETE SWITCH ALSO                  SERI0336
DELD   CAL     PACKED+1      TEST FOR 'THRU EOF'                        SERI0337
       LDQ     PACKED+2                                                 SERI0338
       LGL     18                                                       SERI0339
       ERA     =HRUEOF                                                  SERI0340
       TNZ     BADCC         NO, BAD CONTROL CARD                       SERI0341
       STL     DELTHS        YES, SET DELETE SWITCH AND                 SERI0342
       TRA     DELA          ...GO SET UP EOF SEARCH                    SERI0343
DELTHR VFD     O30/25462660-63305164                                    SERI0344
DELEOF VFD     O24/606060-254626                                        SERI0345
*                                                                       SERI0346
RUNTO  LDI     PACKED+1                                                 SERI0347
       IIS     RUNTOX+1      IS 'EOF' NEXT                              SERI0348
       OFT     INFTY                                                    SERI0349
       TRA     *+2                                                      SERI0350
       TRA     RUNTOF        YES                                        SERI0351
       IIL     25-60         NO, IS BLANK NEXT                          SERI0352
       LFT     /                                                        SERI0353
       TRA     CCLOOK        NO, GO LOOK SOME MORE                      SERI0354
       TRA     B             YES, GO TO PASS OLD TAPE TO NEW            SERI0355
*                                                                       SERI0356
RUNTOF LDQ     INFTY         'EOF', SET INFINITY IN HIGH-ORDER WORD     SERI0357
       STQ     SERNEW        ...OF CONVERTED 'LOW' SERIAL, ZERO IN LOW- SERI0358
       STZ     SERNEW+1      ...ORDER WORD, AND PASS ON TO TAPE-PASSER  SERI0359
*                                                                       SERI0360
*ROUTINE TO PASS CARDS FROM OLD TAPE TO NEW TAPE                        SERI0361
*UNTIL OLD SERIAL MATCHES SERIAL ON 'DELETE' OR                         SERI0362
*'RUN TO' CARD JUST READ FROM SYSTEM INPUT TAPE                         SERI0363
*                                                                       SERI0364
B      NZT     OLDMT         IS OLD BUFFER EMPTY                        SERI0365
       TRA     CA            NO                                         SERI0366
C      STZ     OLDMT         YES                                        SERI0367
       IFEOF   EOFC          READ INTO OLD BUFFER                       SERI0368
       CLA     OLDTAP        FROM CURRENT OLD TAPE                      SERI0369
       CALL    (RD),OLD,SEROLD                                          SERI0370
*                                                                       SERI0371
CA     CAL     SERNEW        COMPARE NEW-OLD IN 73-80                   SERI0372
       LAS     SEROLD                                                   SERI0373
       TRA     CB            DIFFERENT                                  SERI0374
       TRA     *+2                                                      SERI0375
       TRA     CB            DIFFERENT                                  SERI0376
       CAL     SERNEW+1                                                 SERI0377
       LAS     SEROLD+1                                                 SERI0378
       TRA     CB            DIFFERENT                                  SERI0379
       TRA     *+2                                                      SERI0380
       TRA     CB            DIFFERENT                                  SERI0381
       TSX     PUBNEW,4      THE SAME, PUBLISH THE CONTROL CARD         SERI0382
       STL     OLDMT         SET OLD-BUFFER-EMPTY FLAG                  SERI0383
       NZT     DELESW        IS DELETE SWITCH SET                       SERI0384
       TRA     CC            NO                                         SERI0385
       LDI     SEROLD        YES, WAS AN END-OF-FILE DELETED            SERI0386
       ZET     DELTHS        ...OR THE DELETE-THRU SWITCH SET           SERI0387
       LDI     INFTY                                                    SERI0388
       STZ     DELTHS        (RESET THE DELETE-THRU SWITCH)             SERI0389
       ONT     INFTY                                                    SERI0390
       TSX     PUBOLD,4      NO, A RECORD WAS DELETED.  PUBLISH IT      SERI0391
       STZ     DELESW        ...TURN OFF THE DELETE SWITCH              SERI0392
       TRA     A             ...AND RETURN TO CONTROL-CARD SCAN         SERI0393
*                                                                       SERI0394
CC     CLA     NEWTAP        RUN THRU -- COPY OLD CARD                  SERI0395
       CALL    (WR),OLD                                                 SERI0396
       TRA     A             ...AND RETURN TO CONTROL-CARD SCAN         SERI0397
*                                                                       SERI0398
CB     ZET     FCDSW         'OLD' RECORD DOES NOT MATCH, IF FIRST      SERI0399
       TSX     LFEOT,4       ...RECORD OF FILE, TEST FOR END OF RUN     SERI0400
       ZET     DELTHS        IS DELETE-THRU SWITCH SET                  SERI0401
       TRA     C             YES, DELETE THE CARD                       SERI0402
       CLA     NEWTAP        NO, SO WRITE OUT 'OLD' BUFFER              SERI0403
       CALL    (WR),OLD                                                 SERI0404
       TRA     C                                                        SERI0405
*                                                                       SERI0406
EOFC   LDQ     INFTY         END OF FILE ON 'OLD' TAPE                  SERI0407
       STQ     OLD+12        PLACE ALL ONES IN 73-78 OF 'OLD'           SERI0408
       STQ     SEROLD        ...BUFFER AND IN CONVERTED 'OLD'           SERI0409
       STZ     SEROLD+1      ...SERIAL, AND ZERO IN LOW-ORDER WORD      SERI0410
       STL     FCDSW         FIRST-CARD-OF-FILE SWITCH ON               SERI0411
       TRA     CA                                                       SERI0412
*                                                                       SERI0413
*ROUTINE FOR MERGING AND REPLACING                                      SERI0414
*                                                                       SERI0415
ORDNRY NZT     OLDMT         IS OLD BUFFER EMPTY                        SERI0416
       TRA     EA            NO                                         SERI0417
E      STZ     OLDMT         YES, SET FLAG TO NON-EMPTY                 SERI0418
       IFEOF   EOFE          READ INTO OLD BUFFER                       SERI0419
       CLA     OLDTAP        FROM CURRENT OLD TAPE                      SERI0420
       CALL    (RD),OLD,SEROLD                                          SERI0421
*                                                                       SERI0422
EA     CAL     SERNEW        COMPARE NEW-OLD IN 73-80                   SERI0423
       LAS     SEROLD                                                   SERI0424
       TRA     EB            OLD IS LESS, WRITE IT OUT                  SERI0425
       TRA     *+2                                                      SERI0426
       TRA     EC            NEW IS LESS, WRITE IT OUT                  SERI0427
       CAL     SERNEW+1                                                 SERI0428
       LAS     SEROLD+1                                                 SERI0429
       TRA     EB            OLD IS LESS, WRITE IT OUT                  SERI0430
       STL     OLDMT         EQUAL, SET OLD-BUFFER EMPTY FLAG           SERI0431
*                                                                       SERI0432
EC     AXT     2,4           PUBLISH NEW CARD PLUS COMMENT              SERI0433
ECA    LDQ     ECINS+2,4     ...ON SYSTEM OUTPUT TAPE                   SERI0434
       STQ     POSTNW+2,4                                               SERI0435
       TIX     ECA,4,1                                                  SERI0436
       CLA     STMOUT                                                   SERI0437
       STA     *+2                                                      SERI0438
       CALL    WRITE,*-*,PRENEW,17                                      SERI0439
       CLA     NEWTAP        WRITE NEW CARD ON NEW TAPE                 SERI0440
       CALL    (WR),NEW                                                 SERI0441
       ZET     OLDMT         IF OLD-BUFFER-EMPTY FLAG IS SET, PUBLISH   SERI0442
       TSX     PUBOLD,4      ...DELETED CARD ON SYSTEM OUTPUT TAPE      SERI0443
       TRA     A                                                        SERI0444
ECINS  BCI     2,INSERTED                                               SERI0445
*                                                                       SERI0446
EB     ZET     FCDSW         'OLD' RECORD DOES NOT MATCH, IF FIRST      SERI0447
       TSX     LFEOT,4       ...RECORD OF FILE, TEST FOR END OF RUN     SERI0448
       CLA     NEWTAP        NO, SO WRITE OUT 'OLD' BUFFER              SERI0449
       CALL    (WR),OLD                                                 SERI0450
       TRA     E                                                        SERI0451
*                                                                       SERI0452
EOFE   LDQ     INFTY         END OF FILE ON 'OLD' TAPE                  SERI0453
       STQ     OLD+12        PLACE ALL ONES IN 73-78 OF 'OLD'           SERI0454
       STQ     SEROLD        ...BUFFER AND IN CONVERTED 'OLD' SERIAL    SERI0455
       STZ     SEROLD+1      ...AND ZERO IN LOW-ORDER WORD              SERI0456
       STL     FCDSW         TURN FIRST-CARD-OF-FILE SWITCH ON          SERI0457
       TRA     EC            GO INSERT 'NEW' CARD                       SERI0458
*                                                                       SERI0459
LFEOT  SXA     LFEOTX,4      LOOK FOR *ENDTAPE CARD                     SERI0460
       CAL     OLD+12        FIRST SEE IF THIS IS AN END OF FILE        SERI0461
       ERA     INFTY                                                    SERI0462
       TZE     1,4           IF SO, RETURN LEAVING FSTCDF SWITCH SET    SERI0463
       LDI     OLD                                                      SERI0464
       IIL     540000        LOOK FOR ASTERISK IN COLUMN 1              SERI0465
       LFT     770000                                                   SERI0466
       TRA     LFEOTX                                                   SERI0467
       CALL    (PACK),OLD,PACKED,12                                     SERI0468
       AXT     2,4                                                      SERI0469
       CAL     PACKED+2,4                                               SERI0470
       ERA     LFEOTM+2,4                                               SERI0471
       TNZ     LFEOTX                                                   SERI0472
       TIX     *-3,4,1                                                  SERI0473
       TRA     ENDTAP                                                   SERI0474
LFEOTM BCI     2,*ENDTAPE                                               SERI0475
LFEOTX AXT     *-*,4                                                    SERI0476
       STZ     FCDSW                                                    SERI0477
       TRA     1,4                                                      SERI0478
*                                                                       SERI0479
ENDTAP CLA     NEWTAP        CLOSE OUT NEW TAPE                         SERI0480
       TZE     $EXIT         IF TAPE ZERO, JUST QUIT                    SERI0481
       STA     ENDTEF+1                                                 SERI0482
       STA     ENDTRW+1                                                 SERI0483
       CALL    (WR),OLD                                                 SERI0484
ENDTEF CALL    ENDFIL,*-*                                               SERI0485
ENDTRW CALL    REWIND,*-*                                               SERI0486
       CALL    EXIT                                                     SERI0487
       SPACE   1                                                        SERI0488
*                                                                       SERI0489
*ROUTINES FOR CONTROL CARDS OTHER THAN 'DELETE' AND 'RUN TO'            SERI0490
*                                                                       SERI0491
NEWSR  LDI     PACKED+1      MAKE SURE CARD SAYS 'NEW SERIALS'          SERI0492
       IIS     NEWSRX+1                                                 SERI0493
       OFT     INFTY                                                    SERI0494
       TRA     CCLOOK        IT DOES NOT                                SERI0495
       LDQ     SERNEW        IT DOES, GET NEW SERIAL FROM CARD          SERI0496
       STQ     NEWSER        STORE IT IN COMMON                         SERI0497
       LDQ     SERNEW+1                                                 SERI0498
       STQ     NEWSER+1                                                 SERI0499
       STL     SERSW         TURN ON SERIAL SWITCH                      SERI0500
       TRA     FINCON                                                   SERI0501
*                                                                       SERI0502
OLDSR  LDI     PACKED+1      MAKE SURE CARD SAYS 'OLD SERIALS'          SERI0503
       IIS     OLDSRX+1                                                 SERI0504
       OFT     INFTY                                                    SERI0505
       TRA     CCLOOK        IT DOES NOT                                SERI0506
       STZ     SERSW         IT DOES, TURN OFF SERIAL SWITCH            SERI0507
       TRA     FINCON                                                   SERI0508
*                                                                       SERI0509
READA  LDI     PACKED+1      IS TAPE NUMBER 1 OR 2 DIGITS               SERI0510
       IIS     =H0                                                      SERI0511
       OFT     =O7777777777                                             SERI0512
       TRA     CCLOOK        NO, GO LOOK SOME MORE                      SERI0513
       LDQ     PACKED+1      YES, GET TAPE NUMBER                       SERI0514
       ANA     =O17                                                     SERI0515
       LDQ     PACKED+1                                                 SERI0516
       TSX     GETTAP,4                                                 SERI0517
       TZE     BADCC                                                    SERI0518
       STL     FCDSW         SET FIRST-CARD-OF-FILE SWITCH              SERI0519
       LXA     OLDTAP,4      PICK UP FORMER 'OLD' TAPE NUMBER           SERI0520
       STO     OLDTAP        STORE NEW 'OLD' TAPE NUMBER                SERI0521
       ZET     OLDMT         IS OLD BUFFER EMPTY                        SERI0522
       TRA     FINCON        YES, GO AWAY HAPPY                         SERI0523
       STL     OLDMT         NO, EMPTY IT BY BACKSPACING                SERI0524
       SXA     *+2,4                                                    SERI0525
       CALL    BACKR,*-*                                                SERI0526
       TRA     FINCON                                                   SERI0527
*                                                                       SERI0528
WRITEA LDI     PACKED+1      IS TAPE NUMBER 1 OR 2 DIGITS               SERI0529
       IIS     =H00                                                     SERI0530
       OFT     =O77777777                                               SERI0531
       TRA     CCLOOK        NO, GO LOOK SOME MORE                      SERI0532
       PIA                   YES, GET TAPE NUMBER                       SERI0533
       LGR     30                                                       SERI0534
       TSX     GETTAP,4                                                 SERI0535
       STO     NEWTAP                                                   SERI0536
       TRA     FINCON                                                   SERI0537
*                                                                       SERI0538
ENDFL  LDI     PACKED+1      MAKE SURE CARD SAYS 'END FILE'             SERI0539
       IIS     ENDFLX+1                                                 SERI0540
       OFT     =O777760007777                                           SERI0541
       TRA     CCLOOK                                                   SERI0542
       PIA                   GET TAPE NUMBER                            SERI0543
       LGR     18                                                       SERI0544
       TSX     GETTAP,4                                                 SERI0545
       TZE     BADCC                                                    SERI0546
       STA     *+2                                                      SERI0547
       CALL    ENDFIL,*-*    WRITE EOF                                  SERI0548
       TRA     FINCON                                                   SERI0549
*                                                                       SERI0550
REWD   LDI     PACKED+1      MAKE SURE CARD SAYS 'REWIND'               SERI0551
       IIS     REWDX+1                                                  SERI0552
       OFT     =O776000777777                                           SERI0553
       TRA     CCLOOK                                                   SERI0554
       PIA                   GET TAPE NUMBER                            SERI0555
       LGR     24                                                       SERI0556
       TSX     GETTAP,4                                                 SERI0557
       TZE     BADCC                                                    SERI0558
       STA     *+2                                                      SERI0559
       CALL    REWIND,*-*                                               SERI0560
*                                                                       SERI0561
FINCON TSX     PUBNEW,4      PUBLISH CONTROL CARD                       SERI0562
       TRA     A             RETURN TO CONTROL-CARD SCAN                SERI0563
*                                                                       SERI0564
CLOSE  LDI     PACKED+1      IS REST OF CARD BLANK                      SERI0565
       IIS     =H                                                       SERI0566
       OFT     INFTY                                                    SERI0567
       TRA     CCLOOK        NO, GO BACK AND LOOK AGAIN                 SERI0568
       CLA     NEWTAP        YES, IS THERE A 'NEW' TAPE                 SERI0569
       TZE     FINCON        IF NOT, LEAVE                              SERI0570
       STA     CLOSEF+1      SET UP TO CLOSE OUT 'NEW' TAPE             SERI0571
       STA     CLOSEG+1                                                 SERI0572
       STA     CLOSER+1                                                 SERI0573
CLOSEF CALL    ENDFIL,*-*    WRITE EOF                                  SERI0574
       CLA     NEWTAP                                                   SERI0575
       CALL    (WR),CLOSEM   *ENDTAPE                                   SERI0576
CLOSEG CALL    ENDFIL,*-*    EOF                                        SERI0577
CLOSER CALL    REWIND,*-*    AND REWIND                                 SERI0578
       TRA     FINCON        RETURN TO CONTROL-CARD SCAN                SERI0579
CLOSEM BCI     7,*     ENDTAPE                                          SERI0580
       BCI     7,                                                       SERI0581
*                                                                       SERI0582
*                                                                       SERI0583
EXITY  TSX     PUBNEW,4      PUBLISH THE EXIT CONTROL CARD              SERI0584
       CALL    EXIT                                                     SERI0585
